cognic-packs
Copyright 2026 the cognic-packs maintainers.

This repository contains capability packs for the Cognic governed-agent
platform, converted with the Cognic pack importer from plugins published by
Anthropic in https://github.com/anthropics/financial-services (Apache
License 2.0, Copyright Anthropic, PBC). Each pack directory preserves the
upstream instructional content with format adaptations recorded in its
import-report.json. Modifications: conversion to the Cognic pack manifest
format, tool-mapping adaptations listed per pack, and Cognic-specific
governance metadata.
